; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8244                     The assurance to get a valid function pointer is a qualified use-case CSL03 of ComStackLib
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8245  
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8246  \ID SBSW_CANIF_13
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8247  \DESCRIPTION Function call via function pointer
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8248  \COUNTERMEASURE \S  For the generated functions CanIf_BusOffNotificationFctPtr, CanIf_CtrlModeIndicationFctPtr, CanIf_TrcvModeIndicationFctPtr, CanIf_ConfirmPnAvailabilityFctPtr,
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8249                      CanIf_ClearTrcvWufFlagIndicationFctPtr, CanIf_CheckTrcvWakeFlagIndicationFctPtr, CanIf_WakeUpValidationFctPtr, CanIf_RamCheckCorruptControllerIndFctPtr,
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8250                      CanIf_RamCheckCorruptMailboxIndFctPtr it must be secured that a valid function callback is provided with the valid signature.
