; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8253  \DESCRIPTION Access to CanIf_DynTxId via PDU ID which is  indirected over CanIf_TxPduStatic2DynamicIndirection
; ..\BSW\CanIf\CanIf.c	  8254  \COUNTERMEASURE \N Qualified use-case CSL01 of ComStackLib
